@startuml 03-stock-becoming-sellable
title Domain Story 3 — Warehouse Stock Becoming Sellable
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "Warehouse Operator" as Operator
participant "Inventory Availability" as Inventory
participant "Sales Commitment" as Sales
participant "Fulfillment & Delivery" as Fulfillment

Operator -> Inventory : Receive quantity and Inventory Lot
Operator -> Inventory : Record required receiving temperature
Inventory -> Inventory : Accept, HOLD, reject or route ColdChainDisposition
Inventory --> Sales : Expose sellable availability by SKU and Warehouse
Sales -> Inventory : Request full SKU + quantity protection
Inventory -> Inventory : Create deterministic Warehouse Backing
Sales --> Fulfillment : Later request execution against Physical Allocation

note over Inventory,Fulfillment
Physical truth is authoritative. Inventory owns backing and allocation;
Fulfillment executes work against that authority.
end note
@enduml
